=2 Walkthrough
\**{c=red:Note:}** This quest will not appear on your quest list until completion.
* Speak to {n:Bki Tbujhja} {z:Lower Jeuno} H-8, inside the Merry Minstrel, for a hint on where you need to go next.
* **(Optional)** Speak to {n:Mataligeat} for some extra dialogue about {n:Lewenhart}.
